{
    "2": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah, You actually came in here!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In that case let me guide you..."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Through the road of the creepiest mansion."
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on. I'm literally here to ruin this party."
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wow."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They actually transformed this mess into a worse mess.",
                "Surprising."
            ]
        },
        "61_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh? Overlord Alinsky?"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perfect nekomata from the Purgatory",
                "Nyx Kishkin"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I didn't knew you wanted to be on my october party!"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I didn't wanted to be here.",
                "I could be on my manor watching horror movies."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yet you still came in here! Im so glad."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm here to beat your ass. What do you mean you're glad?"
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "W-what?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That I'm here to beat your huge pale black cat ass!"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Augh! So mean!"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you don't even know who am I!"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your name just showed up in front of you so I already know you."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ok actually, Rudy's spirits told me.",
                "But I mostly remember your name for it just showing up."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Augh. This game and it's trend to show names."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So...Now what?"
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, now I beat your ass.",
                "Either that or be a slave for the rest of your days."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Working for halloween's overlord doesn't sounds too bad.",
                "Do I get paid vacations at least?"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eeeeeh..."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, move your ass outta here!",
                "I'll have to think on something to make you work on."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Auh. Just a little more!"
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A little more for what?"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For our fantastic cat moon. It's gonna happen soon."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "there will be more nekomatas, more desserts...",
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And more power for us cat-beasts.",
                "We're gonna be like overlords."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eeeeeh..."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that a yes or a no?"
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Haven't you thought that maybe telling ",
                "this to halloween's overlord Ain't the best idea?"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uuuuum...I forgot about that."
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I already knew it anyways. But that confirms it."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So now you're gonna beat my ass?"
            ]
        },
        "131_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmmmm yes, maybe."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will get to test my own new overlord powers with Overlord Ruby!"
            ]
        },
        "133_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now that's creepy, and honorable."
            ]
        },
        "134_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you forgot to say terryfing too, eh?"
            ]
        },
        "135_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The fantastic cat moon is only 60 percent done.",
                "I think I can work with it!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now before You can go and do your job at my castle...",
                "How's that?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ouchie Ouchies...."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I would've expected that to happen."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You should have. I'm the overlord of destruction.",
                "You know that?"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even so...The fantastic blood moon..."
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Stop thinking about that! Gesh!",

            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We don't need another fake moon doing weird crap now."
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But the one from earlier..."
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Stop it!"
            ]
        },
        "69_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was not even a moon, It was a black hole from makai."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah...I saw that on the news. I was just inspired."
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can really tell that."
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In case you don't know...",
                "There's someone who got summoned during this time."
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, not actually summoned.",
                "We asked him via phone call to get in here, nice weird boy."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? And who's that?"
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He's the grim reaper!"
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The hell? you? summoning the grim reaper?",
                "Good joke."
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He told me we cats could get spirits to make a new moon."
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then refused to elaborate.",
                "And went to sleep like the lazy sissy fox he is."
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Guess that grim reaper guy ain't a big deal then."
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also the hell you meant by he's a \"lazy sissy fox\"?"
            ]
        },
        "81_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because he is!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah, The scary spirits helped you!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In that case, let me guide you..."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Through the fantastic Haunted mansion Road!"
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think you're still drunk."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well Abbey and my spirits were right."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I thought this mansion was gonna stay abandoned forever."
            ]
        },
        "61_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Well it was abandoned."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perfect nekomata from purgatory",
                "Nyx Kishkin"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But me and other cats came here and made it us!"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So that's why This place smells like ass."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't smell that bad it's just a good scent.",

            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So It wasn't black magic...It was the smell."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe that's why my spirits felt disturbed around here."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait wait! Your spirits?"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That clothing...That bow those comically big breasts!",
                "You're..."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A little brat wandering around for your october party.",
                "Don't worry."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Semi Overlord Rudy Alinksy. The necromaniac!",
                "Sister of Halloween's Overlord!"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<i$Maaaaaaybe it's me.>"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who am I kidding. This bow delates me. Yes it's me"
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your chest is what delates you."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, I'm glad you're here for our mansion party.",
                "I never expected overlords to show up."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well...Some spirits snitched on you what was going on in here.",
                "So I'm not here to help ya."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Some more evil spirits even took photos. Truly evil."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<i$So you saw...>"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yep."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nice back views you got."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How troublesome you are for an overlord.",
                "I never expected for you to be a spy."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thought you were just some sadistic necromaniac."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not an spy, I just like to be sneaky."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Though, spying on others is fun not gonna lie."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then, you're a spy, simple."
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That means you know about the fantastic cat moon!"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Coooorrect. I do.",
                "I know all about you guys. Almost all."
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The black cats at the mansion, The moon plan. The desserts...",
                "Oh the desserts you guys eat are delicious."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "True, those pumpkin milkshakes are the best ones."
            ]
        },
        "131_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But do you deserve them after spying on us?",
                "I don't think so..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, It's time for me to take your soul."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My soul?"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can't have that!"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why can't I have it?"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because I'm the one recolecting them...",
                "You can leave me alive for a little longer!"
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And letting you become an overlord?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And having you around saying:",
                "\"Oh look I'm the Cat's overlord!\"?"
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "None of that happening."
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The spirits were actually to make the fantastic cat moon!",
                "That's what someone told us."
            ]
        },
        "69_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You probably need spirits to become an \"Ooooooverlord\"",
                "But to make a moon? Nah."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who the hell even told you that?"
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The grim reaper told us that.",
                "We were trying to summon him earlier for some help."
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He said that we could simply call him via phone call.",
                "And then..he might show up later!"
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then went so sleep and refused to elaborate any further."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And then he went to sleep? Seriously That's it?"
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I need to met this guy. When is he coming?"
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Soon! Probably..."
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He said to wait until 11:21PM and he might show up!",
                "But last week he said in the morning...then midnight and th-"
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ok ok I get it I get it."
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He's probably too lazy to show up in time anyways."
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He last told me he was making pancakes.",
                "He's probably asleep for now."
            ]
        }
    },
    "22": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Knowing your nature, I'm surprised you even came in here!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In that case...let me guide you."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "through the road of the creepiest mansion!"
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't even want to be here in first place."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I know it."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's just another stupid party, I'm going home."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh? Is that another Cat?"
            ]
        },
        "103_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perfect Nekomata from Makai",
                "Nyx Kishkin"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perfect! Someone else that wants to join us!"
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "(Dammit, Should've left before he appeared.)"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You already know the deal. You got any spirits?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Any spirit work! But the ones from yokais are the best ones."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the hell are you talking about?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't even know who the hell you are."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But my name just showed up on the screen."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Nyx Kishkin\" Doesn't magically makes me know you."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fair Point I suppose."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways.",
                "The name's Nyx Kishkin. The nekomata from purgatory!"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You see, I'm not actually from purgatory.",
                "I just thought it sounded cool."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I used to be just some black cat from halloween.",
                "Later I went to live in the purgatory!"
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why didn't you stayed in the Netherworld?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was too boring.",
                "I was thinking the netherworld would be more alive."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You expected the Afterlife to be more alive really?"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You get it, ok.",
                "Sometimes, there's jazz concerts! But everyone feel so dead."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I'll act like I get it.",
                "And jazz doesn't sounds bad. I like jazz."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also, what's going in here? This mansion is a mess."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We cats are gonna prepare something big! Huge!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tonight! we're gonna make a new moon!",
                "The fantastic Cat moon!"
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But we need tons of spirits for that. You could help us."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um..."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm going home."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Join us! You might be a good member for this party."
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It just requires you to get spirits. Its easy!"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm just a normal cat-girl, I can't to that crap."
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I got better things to do."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Better things to do? You're just a halloween cat!",
            ]
        },
        "131_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You got all the time in the world to be as evil as possible."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fine then!",
                "I'll use my time well now! as a halloween cat would."
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, it's time for me to go back home."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ouchie Ouchies...."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who are you exactly? How are you this good?"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you..."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you really waited until now to ask who am I?",
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Better late than never!"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's always good to meet more cats after all."
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I susppose I can say I'm just a cat from halloween country.",
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm fast and I don't know what else to tell you..."
            ]
        },
        "69_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think that's more than enough information."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, you're not someone with supernatural abilities."
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, I told you earlier I'm not a nekomata.",
                "Just a common cat girl."
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A common catgirl won't be able to move at such speeds."
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Meh, cats are fast in general."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, before I leave for real..."
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's your plan with that fantastic blood moon?",
                "Are you gonna still do that or......?"
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well we called over the grim reaper earlier on..."
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? the grim reaper?"
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Does he even exist? Isn't him some urban legend?"
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You will see!",
                "He told us on phone he will show up anytime!"
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And that anytime is?"
            ]
        },
        "81_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He said after he's done taking a shower!",
                "He smells like Apples."
            ]
        }
    }
}